<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <ScenTitle>Bersama Lima, 2003</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;China&amp;nbsp;vs. &lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "st1" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;UK&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt; and ANZAC Forces&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"&gt;Date/Time:&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"&gt;&amp;nbsp;22nd May, 2003/ 08:00:00 Zulu&lt;BR&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"&gt;Location:&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt; South China Sea&lt;BR&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"&gt;Duration:&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;1 Day 12 Hours&lt;BR&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri"&gt;Playable Sides:&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;UK&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt; and ANZAC Forces&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Situation&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;Brunei&lt;/st1:country-region&gt; has complained to the UN on the infringement of its Economic Exclusion Zone by&amp;nbsp;China , these Forces have also been harassing local shipping outside the Zone as well.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;Yesterday&amp;nbsp;the Waspada and Seteria, two of &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;Brunei&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;'s fast attack craft were sunk with the loss of all hands whilst patroling her EEZ, their attackers are unknown but&amp;nbsp;it is belived&amp;nbsp;Chinese units were involved.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;Brunei&lt;/st1:country-region&gt; has requested Military assistance from the &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;United Kingdom&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;, &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;Australia&lt;/st1:country-region&gt; and &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;New Zealand&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;The United Kingdom Government has diverted a Bersama Lima Deployment (TU 544.01.02 and TU 544.01.03 from &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;Singapore&lt;/st1:country-region&gt; to the &lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;South China Sea&lt;/st1:place&gt; in Response.TU 544.01.01 is already on station in the Brunei EEZ.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;Paul Bridge&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;Author and Scenario Designer&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); TEXT-ALIGN: left; FONT: 400 12px Verdana; ORPHANS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(225,225,225); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-size-adjust: none; font-stretch: 100%; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT style="BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e1e1e1" face=Verdana&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT style="BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e1e1e1" face=Verdana&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
